# S443: the fabric the program picks for a repair (the user's rule, for now): an anomaly whose type says only
# corrosion / metal loss (External / Internal allowed) -> E-Glass, its Linear Length of Repair = Corrosion C27, no
# isolation wrap; anything else - or corrosion with something else, or no type found - -> Carbon: the carbon wrap =
